n\"></i>8 min</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"mt-1.5 text-[17px] font-bold leading-[1.32] tracking-[-0.2px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-2\" data-name=\"dish name headline\">Garlic Naan</h3>\n<div class=\"mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-[#6F655C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-3\" data-name=\"dish category tag row\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex h-[13px] w-[13px] items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] border border-[#1F8A4C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-3-1\" data-name=\"category indicator box\"><span class=\"h-[5px] w-[5px] rounded-full bg-[#1F8A4C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"category indicator dot\"></span></span>\n                Breads\n              </div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 min-h-[40px] text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-[#6F655C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-4\" data-name=\"dish description text\">Leavened dough baked in the tandoor, brushed with garlic butter.</p>\n<button class=\"mt-1 inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[#C8430F] transition-colors hover:text-[#F05A24]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-5\" data-name=\"view item button\" type=\"button\">\n                View item <i class=\"mdi mdi-arrow-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-6-2-5-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i>\n</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- 7 -->\n<article class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-7\" data-name=\"dish card\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] bg-[#F7EEE5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-7-1\" data-name=\"dish photo container\">\n<img alt=\"Jeera Rice — Viridiana Rivera on Pexels\" class=\"h-[205px] w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-7-1-1\" data-name=\"Jeera Rice dish photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/34080434/pexels-photo-34080434.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=900&amp;q=80\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-7-2\" data-name=\"dish card details wrapper\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-