655C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-9-2-4\" data-name=\"dish description text\">Assam tea boiled with milk, cardamom and ginger.</p>\n<button class=\"mt-1 inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[#C8430F] transition-colors hover:text-[#F05A24]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-9-2-5\" data-name=\"view item button\" type=\"button\">\n                View item <i class=\"mdi mdi-arrow-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-3-9-2-5-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i>\n</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
