d=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vegetarian indicator box\"><span class=\"h-[5px] w-[5px] rounded-full bg-[var(--zb-veg)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"vegetarian green dot\"></span></span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-1-2\" data-name=\"dish category label\">Drinks</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-2\" data-name=\"dish title and price row\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.01em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-2-1\" data-name=\"dish name heading\">Masala Chai</h3>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[16px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-2-2\" data-name=\"dish price\">₹49</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--zb-muted)] line-clamp-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-3\" data-name=\"dish description text\">Assam tea boiled with milk, cardamom and ginger.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-4\" data-name=\"dish footer row\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-[var(--zb-muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-4-1\" data-name=\"preparation time badge\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mdi mdi-clock-outline text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>6 min</span>\n<button class=\"inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1 rounded-[8px] px-1 text-[13px] font-semibold no-underline text-[var(--zb-accent)] hover:bg-[var(--zb-peach)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-4-2\" data-name=\"view item button\" type=\"button\">View item<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mdi mdi-arrow-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-9-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
