] leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-1-6-9-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<!-- No matching dishes -->\n<section class=\"mt-12 border-t border-[#EDE5DC] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-7\" data-name=\"no results empty state section\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[520px] flex-col items-center px-4 py-12 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1\" data-name=\"empty state content container\">\n<i class=\"mdi mdi-silverware-fork-knife text-[28px] leading-none text-[#B9AC9E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"fork and knife empty state icon\"></i>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"empty state heading\">No dishes found</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#6F655C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"empty state helper text\">Try another search or category.</p>\n<button class=\"mt-5 inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-[#DCD1C5] bg-white px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#25221F] transition-colors hover:border-[#25221F]\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-1-4\" data-name=\"clear filters button\" type=\"button\">\n          Clear filters\n        </button>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>",
